v class=\"opt-text\">àtúntò àwùjọ ọ̀tẹlẹ̀múyẹ́ ti Orílẹ̀-èdè Soviet Union pọn dandan láti lè yẹra fún wàhálà</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">àtúntò àwùjọ ọ̀tẹlẹ̀múyẹ́ jẹ́ ohun tó pọn dandan láti lè yẹra fún píparun Orílẹ̀-èdè Soviet Union</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) àtúntò àwùjọ ọ̀tẹlẹ̀múyẹ́ ti Orílẹ̀-èdè Soviet Union pọn dandan láti lè yẹra fún wàhálà [Subject: High School European History · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>14752cfe346bc2e5f607...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248504 · SUBCSALGO_Q508831</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_CS_ALGO — Programming, Data Structures &amp; Algorithms</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Engineering</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Computer Science (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Computer Science</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Programmer máa lo code tí a tẹ̀jáde lórí ayélujára lábẹ́ ìwé-àṣẹ Ìṣèwádìí Commons Creative (C C B Y). Èwo nínú àwọ̣n àtẹ̀lé yìí ni ó ṣe àpèjúwe lílò code náà ní ònà tí ó ṣe ìtẹ́wọ́gbà jùlọ?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Dída code kọ láti orí ayélujára sínú ohun ti programmer kọ láìṣe ǹkan mìíràn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Dída code kọ láti orí ayélujára sínú ohun tí programmer kọ àti láti dín code tí a dàkọ náà sí ìlà mẹ́wàá</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Dída code kọ láti orí ayélujára sínú ohun tí programmer kọ àti yíyí gbogbo àwọn orúkọ oníyípadà padà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Dída code kọ láti orí ayélujára sínú ohun tí programmer àti gbígbóríyìn fún ẹni tí ó kọọ́ ní ọ̀nà tí ó tẹ̀lé àsẹ.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Dída code kọ láti orí ayélujára sínú ohun tí programmer àti gbígbóríyìn fún ẹni tí ó kọọ́ ní ọ̀nà tí ó tẹ̀lé àsẹ. [Subject: High School Computer Science · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>0c14d8b365b3675c9969...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248503 · SUBSCICHEM_Q508830</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_SCI_CHEMISTRY — Chemistry (Physical, Inorganic, Organic &amp; Analytical)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Science</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Chemistry (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Chemistry</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Èwo ninu iwọnyi ni ó jẹ òtitọ fún gbogbo awọn bési?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Gbogbo awọn bési ni ó dá OH- ions jọ sinu solúṣàn.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn bési tí wọn lagbara nikan ni wọn nsèdásilẹ awọn solúṣàn ninu eyi ti awọn OH- ions wà.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àwọn bési tí wọn lagbara nikan ni wọn jẹ kọndọkitọ dáradára nigbati wọn ba dàpọ mọ soluṣàn.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Fún awọn bési ti kò lagbara, kọnsẹntiréṣàn OH-ions tayọ kọnsẹtiréṣàn ti bési ninu soluṣàn na.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Àwọn bési tí wọn lagbara nikan ni wọn jẹ kọndọkitọ dáradára nigbati wọn ba dàpọ mọ soluṣàn. [Subject: High School Chemistry · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>c9d72675e7ccceace5a7...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248502 · SUBSCICHEM_Q508829</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_SCI_CHEMISTRY — Chemistry (Physical, Inorganic, Organic &amp; Analytical)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Science</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Chemistry (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Chemistry</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Bẹrẹ pẹlu sọluṣàn sitọki ti 18.0 M H2SO4, kini ilana ti ó yẹ lati sedasilẹ 1.00 L apẹẹrẹ ti 3.0 M soluṣàn ti H2SO4 ninu fọlumẹtiriki filasiki kan?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Fi 167 mL kún solúṣàn sitọki si filasiki, lẹhinna rọ omi ti wọn ti sẹ́ sinu filasiki na nigbati o nmi soluṣàn na.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Fi 600 mL ti stọki soluşàn si filaski, lęhinna rọ omi si filasiki ki ó kún pęlu omi ti a şẹ́ bi o ti nro soluşàn na .</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Fi omi sinu filaski na de ibikan, lehinna fi 167 mL sitọki soluşàn, rò ó papọ.  Nipari, rọ omi si iyoku filaski na. .</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Fi omi sinu filaski na de ibikan, lehinna fi 600 mL ti sitọk soluşàn  rò ó lati daapo. Nipari, rọ omi si iyoku filaski na pęlu omi ti won ti şẹ́</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Fi omi sinu filaski na de ibikan, lehinna fi 167 mL sitọki soluşàn, rò ó papọ.  Nipari, rọ omi si iyoku filaski na. . [Subject: High School Chemistry · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>143c331f56528d262724...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248501 · SUBGENCORE_Q508820</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Global Facts</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-