ect: Global Facts · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>c21c3cf92ef01cca7a5a...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248500 · SUBSCIBIOL_Q508796</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_SCI_BIOLOGY — Life Sciences &amp; Biology (Botany, Zoology, Cell Biology, Genetics &amp; Ecology)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Science</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> College Biology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> College Biology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Àwọn ipò tí Charles Darwin dá sílẹ̀ fún yíyan àdáyébá ní gbogbo àwọn nǹkan tó wà nísàlẹ̀ yìí nínú fún àwọn ènìyàn kan ÀṢẸ</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">bí àwọn apilẹ̀ àbùdá kan ṣe máa ń wà lára àwọn apilẹ̀ àbùdá &quot;tó bára mu&quot; àti &quot;tí kò bára mu&quot;</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ìyàtọ̀ tó wà nínú bí àwọn èèyàn ṣe ń wà láàyè àti bí wọ́n ṣe ń bí sí i</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ìdíje nítorí àwọn ohun àmúṣọrọ̀ tó mọ níwọ̀n</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">àwọn ọmọ tó pọ̀ jù</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) bí àwọn apilẹ̀ àbùdá kan ṣe máa ń wà lára àwọn apilẹ̀ àbùdá &quot;tó bára mu&quot; àti &quot;tí kò bára mu&quot; [Subject: College Biology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>ea7d0daf566e52d53678...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248499 · SUBGENCORE_Q508771</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Us Foreign Policy</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Us Foreign Policy (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Us Foreign Policy</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Bawo ni Donald Trump ṣe kọlu agbaye ni ipolongo 2016?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Àgbáyé ti sọ àwọn ọkùnrin bíi tirẹ̀ di ọlọ́rọ̀ ju</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ijọpọ agbaye nikan ṣe anfani awọn ipinlẹ Amẹrika kan, gẹgẹbi New York</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn olutayo ominira ti ṣe iwuri fun agbaye, lakoko ti “awọn ara ilu Amẹrika” padanu awọn iṣẹ nitori rẹ</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìpínlẹ̀ àgbáyé ń fún àwọn ogun ìṣòwò tí ń bàjẹ́ níyànjú</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Awọn olutayo ominira ti ṣe iwuri fun agbaye, lakoko ti “awọn ara ilu Amẹrika” padanu awọn iṣẹ nitori rẹ [Subject: Us Foreign Policy · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>d0e279acda0ea4c19425...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248498 · SUBGENCORE_Q508770</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Us Foreign Policy</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Us Foreign Policy (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Us Foreign Policy</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Bawo ni Otitọ Igbeja ati Otitọ ibinu ṣe yatọ si ni alaye wọn ti ihuwasi ipinlẹ?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn onigbagbo olugbeja gbe tẹnumọ nla lori ipa ti awọn ile-iṣẹ kariaye</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn onigbagbọ ti o ni aabo gbe tẹnumọ diẹ si awọn ifosiwewe agbegbe</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn onigbagbọ ti o ni ibinu fun ni pataki diẹ sii si anfani orilẹ-ede ju awọn onigbagbọ olugbeja.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn onigbagbọ aabo gbagbọ pe awọn ipinlẹ jẹ awọn olupolowo aabo, lakoko ti awọn onigbagbọ ibinu gbagbọ pe awọn ipinlẹ jẹ awọn maximizers agbara.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Awọn onigbagbọ aabo gbagbọ pe awọn ipinlẹ jẹ awọn olupolowo aabo, lakoko ti awọn onigbagbọ ibinu gbagbọ pe awọn ipinlẹ jẹ awọn maximizers agbara. [Subject: Us Foreign Policy · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>825349f334381d42ffff...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248497 · SUBGENCORE_Q508764</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Sociology</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Sociology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Sociology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Iyipada lati &#x27;ẹsin ilu&#x27; si &#x27;ẹsin ti o wọpọ&#x27; tumọ si pe:</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">awọn npo bureaucracy ti ipinle ti ṣe esin nikan kan iwonba ara ti aye wa</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">pelu irẹwẹsi ti aṣẹ ibile, awọn igbesi aye ojoojumọ wa ati &#x27;oye ti o wọpọ&#x27; wa ni apẹrẹ nipasẹ awọn igbagbọ ati awọn idiyele ẹsin</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìkópa ẹ̀sìn nínú ìjọsìn àpapọ̀ lè ti dín kù, ṣùgbọ́n àwọn ènìyàn ṣì ń ṣe ìgbàgbọ́ wọn ní ìkọ̀kọ̀</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">eniyan ni o ṣeeṣe pupọ lati jiroro lori awọn igbagbọ ẹsin wọn ni gbangba, awọn eto aijẹmọ</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) pelu irẹwẹsi ti aṣẹ ibile, awọn igbesi aye ojoojumọ wa ati &#x27;oye ti o wọpọ&#x27; wa ni apẹrẹ nipasẹ awọn igbagbọ ati awọn idiyele ẹsin [Subject: Sociology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>b10c431e55b1148d5e11...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248496 · SUBGENCORE_Q508761</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kini awọn ilana ti itupalẹ laarin eyiti a ti gbero ipanilaya (bii ti 2020)?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Idije laarin awọn orilẹ-ede nla ti yorisi ni diẹ ninu awọn orilẹ-ede ti n ṣe atilẹyin awọn ẹgbẹ apanilaya lati ba agbara awọn ipinlẹ orogun jẹ. Awọn nẹtiwọọki apanilaya jẹ awọn ẹgbẹ alamọdaju ti o gbooro ti a tọju ati sanwo fun nipasẹ awọn ipinlẹ oluranlọwọ wọn ati pe wọn ni imọran bi awọn oṣere ipinlẹ, lati ṣe pẹlu lilo agbara ologun.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ijọpọ agbaye ti jẹ ki isọdọkan agbaye ti awọn iṣẹ apanilaya ṣiṣẹ nipa ṣiṣi aaye iṣẹ wọn, botilẹjẹpe isọdọkan ṣi ni iṣakoso lati ipilẹ agbegbe kan. Eyi ṣe imọran pe awọn ẹgbẹ onijagidijagan ti wa ni ipilẹ ti orilẹ-ede eyiti o tumọ si pe ipanilaya ko le ṣe akiyesi ni awọn ofin ti ogun lati ṣẹgun ni ologun laisi nini awọn ipa pataki lori olugbe abinibi.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ipanilaya ni a le wo bi iṣoro lati yanju nipasẹ awọn ọna ologun (ogun lori ipanilaya), nipasẹ awọn ilana ọlọpa deede (ipanilaya bi ilufin), tabi bi iṣoro iṣoogun pẹlu awọn okunfa ati awọn aami aiṣan (ipanilaya bi arun).</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ipanilaya ni a wo bi iṣoro ọdaràn. Awọn odaran ti ipanilaya ni awọn ipa pataki meji. Ni akọkọ, o ni imọran pe a le pa awọn ipanilaya kuro - a le mu awọn onijagidijagan ati mu wa si ẹjọ nipasẹ awọn ilana idajọ deede nitorinaa yọkuro irokeke naa kuro ni awujọ - ati ni ẹẹkeji, o ni imọran pe awọn ilana ipanilaya idena jẹ iwulo lati ṣe idiwọ idagbasoke rẹ.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Ipanilaya ni a le wo bi iṣoro lati yanju nipasẹ awọn ọna ologun (ogun lori ipanilaya), nipasẹ awọn ilana ọlọpa deede (ipanilaya bi ilufin), tabi bi iṣoro iṣoogun pẹlu awọn okunfa ati awọn aami aiṣan (ipanilaya bi arun). [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>aaf09b9db0f704bcd3c7...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248495 · SUBGENCORE_Q508760</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Bawo ni a ṣe le ṣe apejuwe ti o dara julọ ni ibatan laarin ọna-ipinnu-ipinlẹ ati imọran ti aabo eniyan?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Iru awọn ipin jakejado wa laarin ilana aabo eniyan nipa iru awọn irokeke ati awọn nkan itọkasi ti ko si awọn afiwera jakejado laarin awọn isunmọ aarin-ipinlẹ ati aabo eniyan ti o le fa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nipa gbigbe ilana ti aabo eniyan, awọn idiwọn ti ọna gidi-centric ti ipinlẹ di mimọ. Lakoko ti aabo eniyan ṣe asọye ohun itọkasi bi eniyan tabi olugbe, awọn isunmọ aarin-ipinlẹ ṣe pataki aabo ti ipinlẹ, ni yiyọkuro ilepa aabo eniyan.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ọna aarin-ilu si aabo jẹ apakan ti aabo eniyan, nigbagbogbo asọye laarin ile-iwe gbooro ti aabo eniyan. Nipa jijẹ aarin-ipinlẹ ọna yii ṣe pataki fun ẹni kọọkan gẹgẹbi ohun itọkasi ni awọn ijinlẹ aabo.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mejeeji ti ipinlẹ-centric ati awọn isunmọ-centric eniyan si aabo jẹ iyasọtọ ti ara wọn ati funni ni ilana atupale ti o to eyiti lati loye eto aabo agbaye. Nitorina o jẹ ipa ti awọn atunnkanka aabo lati pinnu eyiti ninu awọn imọran pataki wọnyi ti o tọ, ati eyiti o yẹ ki o sọnu.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Nipa gbigbe ilana ti aabo eniyan, awọn idiwọn ti ọna gidi-centric ti ipinlẹ di mimọ. Lakoko ti aabo eniyan ṣe asọye ohun itọkasi bi eniyan tabi olugbe, awọn isunmọ aarin-ipinlẹ ṣe pataki aabo ti ipinlẹ, ni yiyọkuro ilepa aabo eniyan. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>1d79c416aba6d13d1339...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248494 · SUBGENCORE_Q508759</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Lati le di aabo, irokeke kan gbọdọ wa ni gbekalẹ ninu awọn ọna wọnyi?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Gẹgẹbi irokeke ayeraye ti o nilo igbese lẹsẹkẹsẹ ati iyalẹnu, ti n ṣe irokeke ewu si iwalaaye ti ipinle tabi si aabo awujọ.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bi o nilo igbese lẹsẹkẹsẹ ati iyalẹnu nipasẹ ipinlẹ, idẹruba iwalaaye ti nkan itọkasi ati nitorinaa ṣe atilẹyin fun lilo awọn igbese ti kii ṣe deede oojọ ni agbegbe iṣelu.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bi ohun amojuto ni irokeke ewu si iwalaaye ti awọn referent ohun, ki pataki ti o legitimizes awọn oojọ ti extraordinary igbese ni esi.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Gẹgẹbi irokeke iyara si iwalaaye ti olugbo ti o nilo awọn igbese iyalẹnu tabi pajawiri.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Bi ohun amojuto ni irokeke ewu si iwalaaye ti awọn referent ohun, ki pataki ti o legitimizes awọn oojọ ti extraordinary igbese ni esi. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>826842d6823e1776d930...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248493 · SUBGENCORE_Q508757</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kini o ṣe iyatọ si diplomacy ti agbara lati agbara ologun?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ifarabalẹ jẹ ọrọ miiran fun diplomacy coercive, ṣugbọn ibora ti ṣeto awọn ibeere dín; ifarapa ni wiwa awọn irokeke wọnyẹn ti o pinnu lati pilẹṣẹ igbese ọta. Irokeke lati fi ipa mu ipinlẹ kan lati fi apakan ti agbegbe rẹ silẹ yoo ka bi diplomacy ti ipaniyan, niwọn igba ti irokeke yẹn ba bẹrẹ igbese ni itara ṣaaju ki o to gbe diplomacy ifaseyin.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">diplomacy ti agbara mu jẹ awọn irokeke ti ipa to lopin lati fa iwuri ọta lati ni ibamu pẹlu awọn ibeere apaniyan. O jẹ ilana ipa ti o pinnu lati gba ibamu: lilo agbara lati ṣẹgun alatako ni akọkọ ko ka. O fi ipin yiyan silẹ pẹlu ibi-afẹde lati ni ibamu, tabi lati tẹsiwaju.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Agbara ologun, tabi irokeke ti agbara ologun, nlo iberu lati ṣaṣeyọri awọn ibi-afẹde ilana. diplomacy ti ipaniyan jẹ iyatọ si ọna yii, nitori ko lo iberu bi ohun elo fun ipaniyan ọta.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Iṣẹ diplomacy ti ipaniyan jẹ iṣẹ lati lo ipa ṣugbọn lati fi opin si awọn ipa rẹ lori agbegbe agbaye. diplomacy coercive jẹ ilana ibinu ti o pinnu lati gba ibamu nipasẹ ijatil. Ko fi ipin kan ti o yan silẹ pẹlu ibi-afẹde, ibi-afẹde boya a fi agbara mu lati ni ibamu tabi olukoni ninu ija. O n wa lati ṣakoso nipasẹ gbigbe ibamu nipa yiyọ eyikeyi aye fun idunadura tabi adehun.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) diplomacy ti agbara mu jẹ awọn irokeke ti ipa to lopin lati fa iwuri ọta lati ni ibamu pẹlu awọn ibeere apaniyan. O jẹ ilana ipa ti o pinnu lati gba ibamu: lilo agbara lati ṣẹgun alatako ni akọkọ ko ka. O fi ipin yiyan silẹ pẹlu ibi-afẹde lati ni ibamu, tabi lati tẹsiwaju. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>76d4c43db6ad7106b9f8...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248492 · SUBHUMPSYC_Q508747</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HUM_PSYCHOLOGY — Psychology (Cognitive, Developmental, Social, Clinical &amp; Research Methods)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Humanities</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Psychology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Psychology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ọkan ninu awọn alabara itọju ailera rẹ beere imọran rẹ nipa eto idinku iwuwo to dara. O ti ṣe iwadii awọn eto ni agbegbe ati pe o forukọsilẹ ni ọkan ti o ro pe o dara julọ. Eto yii nfunni ni ẹbun USD 50 kan si awọn onibajẹ rẹ fun eniyan tuntun kọọkan ti wọn mu wa sinu eto naa. Labẹ awọn ipo wọnyi, idahun ti o yẹ julọ yoo jẹ si</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">sọ fun alabara rẹ awọn anfani ati alailanfani ti eto kọọkan ti o mọ nipa ayafi ti ọkan ninu eyiti o forukọsilẹ</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ṣeduro fun alabara rẹ eto ninu eyiti o forukọsilẹ ati ṣalaye ẹbun USD 50 ti iwọ yoo gba</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ṣeduro fun alabara rẹ eto ninu eyiti o forukọsilẹ ati funni lati ni ẹbun USD 50 ti a ka si akọọlẹ alabara rẹ ninu eto naa</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">sọ fun alabara rẹ awọn anfani ati alailanfani ti eto kọọkan ti o mọ nipa rẹ, ṣugbọn maṣe beere ẹbun USD 50 ti alabara rẹ ba forukọsilẹ ninu eto rẹ</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) sọ fun alabara rẹ awọn anfani ati alailanfani ti eto kọọkan ti o mọ nipa rẹ, ṣugbọn maṣe beere ẹbun USD 50 ti alabara rẹ ba forukọsilẹ ninu eto rẹ [Subject: Professional Psychology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>3dce617ec8abd465c788...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248491 · SUBLAWCONS_Q508741</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ọmọkunrin kan jẹ onigbese <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>5,000. Bàbá ọmọ náà kàn sí ayánilówó náà ó sì sọ fún un pé òun fẹ́ san gbèsè ọmọ náà. Baba naa fowo si iwe kan ti o sọ pe baba yoo san gbese ọmọ naa ni oṣuwọn </mi></mrow></math>500 ni oṣu fun oṣu mẹwa. Onigbese naa ko ṣe adehun iwe-kikọ tabi ti ẹnu lati farada lati pe ọmọ naa lati gba gbese <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi> 5,000, ati pe baba ko ṣe ibeere ẹnu tabi kikọ fun eyikeyi iru ifarada bẹẹ. Fun oṣu marun to nbọ, baba naa ṣe ati ayanilowo gba awọn sisanwo </mi></mrow></math>500 oṣooṣu bi o ti gba. Láàárín àkókò yẹn, ayánilówó, ní ti tòótọ́, kọ̀ láti gbé ìgbésẹ̀ lọ́nà òfin èyíkéyìí lòdì sí ọmọkùnrin náà. Sibẹsibẹ, baba lẹhinna sọ fun onigbese pe oun kii yoo san owo siwaju sii lori gbese naa. Ewo ninu awọn wọnyi ni ariyanjiyan ti o ni idaniloju julọ pe baba jẹ oniduro si onigbese labẹ awọn ofin ti adehun wọn?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ileri baba ati igbẹkẹle ti onigbese lori rẹ, ti o ba jẹri, jẹ ki ẹtọ ẹtọ ti onigbese lodi si baba ti o da lori ẹkọ ti promissory estoppel.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nítorí pé ó ṣeé ṣe kó jẹ́ pé ìlérí bàbá náà máa jẹ́ kí ẹni tó jẹ gbèsè má ṣe gbé ìgbésẹ̀ èyíkéyìí lòdì sí ọmọ rẹ̀, irú ìfaradà bẹ́ẹ̀ jẹ́, gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀ràn òfin, àfikún fún ìgbatẹnirò fún ìlérí bàbá.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn sisanwo marun ti baba fun onigbese lapapọ USD  2,500 ṣe afihan ero pataki kan ni apakan baba lati di adehun adehun, ati pe iru ifarahan bẹẹ ni a mọ ni gbogbogbo bi aropo ti o munadoko fun ero.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nipa gbigbero gbese gbese iṣaaju ti ọmọ jẹ gbese si onigbese, baba naa di oniduro ti ileri rẹ si ayanilowo jẹ imuṣẹ, nitori pe o wa ni kikọ ati atilẹyin nipasẹ akiyesi deedee.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Ileri baba ati igbẹkẹle ti onigbese lori rẹ, ti o ba jẹri, jẹ ki ẹtọ ẹtọ ti onigbese lodi si baba ti o da lori ẹkọ ti promissory estoppel. [Subject: Professional Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>610749de6cf5e85025dc...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248490 · SUBGENCORE_Q508717</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Nutrition</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Nutrition (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Nutrition</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ninu iwadi ẹgbẹ kan, ipin eewu ti idagbasoke àtọgbẹ jẹ 0.86 nigbati o ba ṣe afiwe awọn alabara tii (ti o han) si awọn ti ko mu tii (airotẹlẹ). Alaye wo ni o tọ (ni ibamu si imọ ni 2020)?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn ti nmu tii ni eewu kekere ti idagbasoke àtọgbẹ.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn ti nmu tii ni eewu ti o ga julọ ti idagbasoke àtọgbẹ.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Da lori alaye ti a fun ni a ko le sọ boya iyatọ ti a ṣe akiyesi ni eewu arun jẹ abajade ti aye.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ipin eewu ti sunmọ iye ọkan, nitorinaa ko si iyatọ ninu eewu arun laarin awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Da lori alaye ti a fun ni a ko le sọ boya iyatọ ti a ṣe akiyesi ni eewu arun jẹ abajade ti aye. [Subject: Nutrition · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>c469c2ee3addb0c6d33b...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n  