ji adayeba, ewu kekere ti ipalara yoo wa fun SCNT.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">mejeeji A ati B</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">bẹni A tabi B</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) SCNT kii ṣe iru ẹda ti o yatọ nitori pe ko si awọn iyatọ ti o ni ibatan ti iwa laarin rẹ ati awọn ọna idasilẹ miiran ti ẹda. [Subject: Moral Disputes · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>327a1daa0393b24175af...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248487 · SUBGENCORE_Q508704</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Marketing</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Marketing (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Marketing</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ewo ninu atẹle naa jẹ arosinu ni awọn ilana ilana ti awọn iwulo Maslow?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn iwulo da lori aṣa ati paapaa lori kilasi awujọ.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn iwulo ipele-isalẹ gbọdọ jẹ o kere ju ni itẹlọrun ni apakan ṣaaju awọn iwulo giga le ni ipa lori ihuwasi.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn iwulo ko ṣe pataki tabi ṣeto ni eyikeyi aṣẹ pato.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn iwulo ti o ni itẹlọrun jẹ awọn iwuri, ati pe awọn iwulo tuntun farahan nigbati awọn iwulo lọwọlọwọ ko ba pade.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Awọn iwulo ipele-isalẹ gbọdọ jẹ o kere ju ni itẹlọrun ni apakan ṣaaju awọn iwulo giga le ni ipa lori ihuwasi. [Subject: Marketing · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>5294c830609222e95d5f...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248486 · SUBGENCORE_Q508693</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Logical Fallacies</span>\n    