>D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Iyọọda ti Orilẹ-ede kan lati dè ni afihan nipasẹ ọna eyikeyi ti wọn yan</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Iyọọda ti ilu lati di adehun nipasẹ adehun le jẹ afihan nipasẹ ibuwọlu, ifọwọsi, gbigba, ifọwọsi tabi isọdọkan [Subject: International Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>7bd70c39ce11c45110d2...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248484 · SUBLAWCONS_Q508685</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> International Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> International Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Nigbawo ni &#x27;igbanilaaye&#x27; le ṣiṣẹ bi ipo ti o ṣe idiwọ aitọ ti iwa Ilu kan?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìyọ̀ǹda lè ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ipò kan tí ń ṣèdíwọ́ fún àìtọ́ nígbàkúùgbà tí a bá fúnni</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ìyọ̀ǹda kò lè ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ kan tí ń tako ìwà àìtọ́</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ifọwọsi le ṣiṣẹ bi ipo ti o yago fun aiṣedeede, ti o ba jẹ pe igbanilaaye ba wulo ati ni iwọn ti ihuwasi naa wa laarin awọn opin aṣẹ ti a fun ni.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Igbanilaaye le ṣiṣẹ nigbagbogbo bi ipo ti o yago fun aiṣedeede, laibikita ẹya ti Ipinle yoo fun ni</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Ifọwọsi le ṣiṣẹ bi ipo ti o yago fun aiṣedeede, ti o ba jẹ pe igbanilaaye ba wulo ati ni iwọn ti ihuwasi naa wa laarin awọn opin aṣẹ ti a fun ni. [Subject: International Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>adf9c2e7abc78d23de92...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248483 · SUBLAWCONS_Q508683</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> International Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> International Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kini adajo ad hoc?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ti o ba jẹ pe ẹgbẹ kan si ẹjọ ariyanjiyan ṣaaju ki ICJ ko ni ijoko orilẹ-ede gẹgẹbi onidajọ, o ni ẹtọ lati yan ẹnikan gẹgẹbi onidajọ fun ẹjọ naa nikan, pẹlu akọle ti adajọ ad hoc</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Adajọ ad hoc jẹ ọmọ ẹgbẹ ti ibujoko ti ICJ pẹlu idibo simẹnti</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Adajọ ad hoc jẹ adajọ ti o jẹ aropo, ti o ba jẹ pe onidajọ ko ni ẹtọ tabi kọja lọ</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Adajọ ad hoc jẹ onidajọ ti ẹgbẹ kọọkan yoo yan nigbagbogbo ni gbogbo ẹjọ ariyanjiyan</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Ti o ba jẹ pe ẹgbẹ kan si ẹjọ ariyanjiyan ṣaaju ki ICJ ko ni ijoko orilẹ-ede gẹgẹbi onidajọ, o ni ẹtọ lati yan ẹnikan gẹgẹbi onidajọ fun ẹjọ naa nikan, pẹlu akọle ti adajọ ad hoc [Subject: International Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>85cda8471349bca8fc98...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248482 · SUBGENCORE_Q508659</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — High School Statistics</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Statistics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Statistics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Lẹ́yìn ìkìlọ̀ òtútù kan, ẹni tó ni pápá ọsàn ńlá kan ní kí àwọn òṣìṣẹ́ rẹ̀ fi omi fún gbogbo igi rẹ̀. Omi naa yẹ ki o di didi ki o si ṣe ibora aabo ti yinyin ni ayika itanna osan naa. Sibẹsibẹ, oniwun fura pe diẹ ninu awọn igi jiya ibajẹ nla nitori Frost. Lati ṣe iṣiro ipin ti awọn igi ti o jiya diẹ sii ju 50 ogorun ibajẹ nitori Frost, o mu apẹẹrẹ laileto ti awọn igi 100 lati inu ọgba rẹ. Kini iyipada idahun ni idanwo yii?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn ipin ti awọn igi ti o jiya diẹ sii ju 50 ogorun bibajẹ nitori Frost.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn nọmba ti awọn igi fowo nipasẹ awọn Frost.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nọmba awọn igi ti a ṣe ayẹwo lati inu ọgba.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Fun igi ayẹwo kọọkan, boya o jiya diẹ sii ju 50 ogorun bibajẹ tabi ni julọ 50 ogorun bibajẹ.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Fun igi ayẹwo kọọkan, boya o jiya diẹ sii ju 50 ogorun bibajẹ tabi ni julọ 50 ogorun bibajẹ. [Subject: High School Statistics · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>c404d05cc5f338ba2134...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248481 · SUBGENCORE_Q508657</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — High School Statistics</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Statistics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Statistics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ewo ninu atẹle yii jẹ alaye to pe nipa isọdọkan?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ti ite ti laini ipadasẹhin jẹ deede 1, lẹhinna ibaramu jẹ deede 1.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ti ibamu ba jẹ 0, lẹhinna ite ti laini ipadasẹhin jẹ aisọye.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Yiyipada eyi ti oniyipada ti a npe ni x ati eyi ti a npe ni y yi ami ti ibamu pada.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ibaṣepọ r jẹ dogba si ite ti laini ipadasẹhin nigbati awọn nọmba z-ayipada fun y-ayipada ti wa ni igbero lodi si awọn ami-z fun oniyipada x.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Ibaṣepọ r jẹ dogba si ite ti laini ipadasẹhin nigbati awọn nọmba z-ayipada fun y-ayipada ti wa ni igbero lodi si awọn ami-z fun oniyipada x. [Subject: High School Statistics · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>60a8bcdc387409f5183d...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248480 · SUBMEDENT_Q508630</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_MED_ENT — Otorhinolaryngology (ENT)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Medical &amp; Health Sciences</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Government And Politics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Government And Politics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ewo ninu awọn alaye atẹle nipa awọn apa minisita jẹ Eke?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wọn ti fi idi rẹ mulẹ nipasẹ ẹka ile-igbimọ.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ wọn nigbagbogbo ko ni ipa pupọ lori awọn ipinnu Alakoso.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Gbogbo wọn ko le ṣe akoso nipasẹ awọn aṣaaju ti wọn wa ninu ẹgbẹ oṣelu kanna ti aarẹ ṣe.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kii ṣe gbogbo ile-iṣẹ ijọba apapọ jẹ ẹka minisita.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Gbogbo wọn ko le ṣe akoso nipasẹ awọn aṣaaju ti wọn wa ninu ẹgbẹ oṣelu kanna ti aarẹ ṣe. [Subject: High School Government And Politics · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>05a9d383651f3653b088...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248479 · SUBGENCORE_Q508624</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">COUNTRY_LOCAL: United States</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — High School Geography</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Geography (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Geography</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Èwo nínú àwọn gbólóhùn wọ̀nyí kò péye nípa àwọn ìpèsè tí àwọn ìjọba ìbílẹ̀ pèsè ní United States?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Isepo ti akitiyan waye nigbagbogbo.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn iṣoro awujọ ti aarin ilu ṣan silẹ sinu awọn agbegbe ibugbe agbegbe.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ailagbara ni ipese awọn iṣẹ waye nigbagbogbo.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Awọn igbiyanju agbegbe kan lati dinku idoti nigbagbogbo ni atilẹyin nipasẹ awọn agbegbe agbegbe.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Awọn igbiyanju agbegbe kan lati dinku idoti nigbagbogbo ni atilẹyin nipasẹ awọn agbegbe agbegbe. [Subject: High School Geography · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>0703e670b3b7c1ab4a20...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    "}
